OL,3,ASuspected bomb hoax threats force fresh
OL,4,Aevacuations of Italian schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in Scotland and Northern
OL,7,FIreland received threats on Wednesday,
OL,8,Ftoo. It is unclear whether the
OL,9,Fincidents are connected.
